coder › Implemented debounce on branch `work/debounce` (2 commits).

What changed:
- `src/debounce.ts`: implemented `debounce(fn, ms, timers)`. Each call stores the latest args, clears any pending timer via `timers.clearTimeout`, and schedules a new one via `timers.setTimeout`. On fire it calls `fn` with the most recent args. `cancel()` clears the pending timer and drops stored args; `flush()` clears the timer and immediately calls `fn` with stored args if one is pending. `ms < 0` throws `RangeError`.
- `src/debounce.test.ts`: added 10 tests (kept the existing `returns a function` test): latest-args-after-ms, timer reset on calls within `ms`, separate bursts, `cancel` drops pending / no-op when idle, `flush` runs immediately + cancels timer / no-op when idle, negative `ms` throws `RangeError`, `ms: 0` fires on next tick, default global timers work with real time.

Checks (`bun test`):
